    <string name="setup_title">Your game files are needed</string>
    <string name="setup_explanation">This app only contains the port\'s own code. To play, you need your own extracted copy of Gears of War 2: the folder that contains default.xex.\n\nChoose that folder and the app copies it into its own storage. The game memory-maps its files and Android cannot memory-map files opened through the folder picker, so the copy needs as much free space as the game takes.\n\nYou can also copy the folder yourself, for example over USB from a PC, so that default.xex ends up in:</string>
